@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@cartId = replace-with-cartId-from-create-response

### Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts

### Read
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/{{cartId}}

### Add (increments existing line)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "quantity": 2}

### Replace quantity
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/{{cartId}}/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 3}

### Remove
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/{{cartId}}/items/1

### Validation error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "quantity": 0}
